{"scope": "live_study_operation_receipt_readback", "fixture_version": "study-quality-v1", "git_revision": "c8f5b43d3f1db4725fbd4c216eaf6b1b56c72342", "case_id": "code_and_math", "repetition": 0, "model": "MiniMax-M3", "message": "请用中文说明 2x+3=11 的解，含一条 LaTeX 行内公式，再给一个 python 代码块用 assert 验证答案。不要生成图或题目。", "calls": [{"kind": "chat", "model": "MiniMax-M3", "max_tokens": 4096, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 2735, "prompt_tokens": 5447, "total_tokens": 8182, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0}, "total_characters": 0}, "finish_reason": "stop", "elapsed_ms": 29529}], "http_status": 200, "receipt": {"operation_id": "study-chat-op-13bb50947ec7445b", "session_id": "session-2e1efc5768", "client_request_id": "quality-code_and_math-0", "status": "committed", "safe_to_retry": false, "created_at": "2026-09-11T17:36:35.407000+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-11T17:37:05.171682+00:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-11T17:37:05.171682+00:00", "admitted_session_revision": 0, "committed_session_revision": 1, "committed_turn_id": "turn-7bc587c5f205445c", "committed_turn_sequence": 1, "error_code": "", "result": {"reply": "小林，我们把 $2x+3=11$ 按章节里的两步法走一遍。\n\n- 第一步：两边同时减去 3，把常数项从左边移到右边，得到 $2x = 11 - 3 = 8$。\n- 第二步：两边同时除以系数 2，孤立未知数，得到 $x = \\dfrac{8}{2} = 4$。\n- 第三步：把 $x=4$ 代回原式，左边 $2 \\times 4 + 3 = 11$，恰好等于右边 11，验证成立。\n\n下方代码块用 assert 把移项、求解、代回三步都钉死，便于你以后改题时直接复用。", "citations": [{"section_id": "doc-c5d887db81:section:l1:1", "title": "Chapter 1 Linear Equations", "page_start": 1, "page_end": 1, "source_kind": "document", "source_id": ""}], "character_events": [{"emotion": "calm", "action": "抬笔写下 2x+3=11，笔尖划向 2x=8，再点向 x=4。", "speech_style": "warm", "scene_hint": "study_session:doc-c5d887db81:study-unit:1:p1-1", "line_segment_id": "session-2e1efc5768:chat:0", "timing_hint": "after_text", "tool_name": "", "tool_summary": "", "delivery_cue": "节奏放稳，逐项点读等式两边，最后一句压低声调强调代入验证。", "commentary": "用户只要简洁可复用的解题与验证说明，故压缩为三步口述加一段 assert 代码，不出图、不出题。"}], "rich_blocks": [{"kind": "code", "content": "def solve_linear_equation():\n    # 待解方程：2x + 3 = 11\n    a, b, c = 2, 3, 11\n\n    # 第一步：两边减 b，移项得到 a*x = c - b\n    rhs_after_subtract = c - b\n    assert rhs_after_subtract == 8, f\"移项后期望 8，实际得到 {rhs_after_subtract}\"\n\n    # 第二步：两边除以 a，得到 x = (c - b) / a\n    x = rhs_after_subtract / a\n    assert x == 4, f\"求解后期望 x=4，实际得到 {x}\"\n\n    # 第三步：代回原方程验证\n    lhs = a * x + b\n    assert lhs == c, f\"代入后左边={lhs}，右边={c}，不一致\"\n\n    print(f\"x = {x},  2*{int(x)} + 3 = {int(lhs)},  等于 {c},  验证通过\")\n\nsolve_linear_equation()"}], "interactive_question": null, "persona_slot_trace": [{"kind": "teaching_method", "label": "Method", "content_excerpt": "Socratic", "reason": "作为人格基础策略默认参与"}], "memory_trace": [{"session_id": "session-a4bde6a660", "study_unit_id": "doc-c5d887db81:study-unit:1", "scene_title": "未设置场景", "score": 0.3291, "snippet": "请用恰好三条 Markdown 无序列表讲解 2x+3=11 的求解和检验，每条一句。不要开场白、标题、结尾或出题。 - 移项：等式两边同时减去 3，由 $2x+3=11$ 得到 $2x=8$，这一步把常数项从左边搬到右边。 - 求解：两边再同时除以系数 2，得 $x=4$，因为方程是一次的，只要除以非零的 $a$ 就能把未知数孤立出来。 - 检验：把...", "created_at": "2026-09-11T17:36:35.386556+00:00", "source": "retriever"}], "tool_calls": [], "scene_profile": null, "model_recoveries": [], "session": {"id": "session-2e1efc5768", "document_id": "doc-c5d887db81", "persona_id": "persona-d57c4f218cb3471da112a5bcf10df133", "plan_id": null, "scene_instance_id": "", "scene_profile": null, "study_unit_id": "doc-c5d887db81:study-unit:1", "study_unit_title": "Chapter 1 Linear Equations", "theme_hint": "", "session_system_prompt": "会话运行时上下文：\n- 人格：顾言\n- 人格关系：数学老师与成年学习者\n- 学习者称呼：小林\n- 学习资料 / 计划主题：linear-equations-quality\n- 当前学习单元 ID：doc-c5d887db81:study-unit:1\n- 当前学习单元标题：Chapter 1 Linear Equations\n- 当前主题：无\n- 场景摘要：无\n- 场景标题：无\n- 场景路径：无\n- 关键物体：无\n- 场景标签：无\n- 场景树根节点：无\n\n规则：\n- 默认保持在当前学习单元内回答，除非用户明确要求切换上下文。\n- 以上信息只补充当前会话上下文，不覆盖人格主设定。\n- 保持与当前人格的语气、教学方法和叙事方式一致。\n- 如果当前会话绑定了真实教材，回答应以教材证据为核心，不做无根据扩展。\n- 如果当前会话没有真实教材而是目标导向计划，应以当前学习单元目标、计划主题和用户问题为核心，给出可学习、可练习、可复盘的讲解路径，不要反复假设存在教材页码。", "status": "active", "turns": [{"id": "turn-7bc587c5f205445c", "sequence": 1, "learner_message": "请用中文说明 2x+3=11 的解，含一条 LaTeX 行内公式，再给一个 python 代码块用 assert 验证答案。不要生成图或题目。", "learner_message_kind": "learner", "learner_attachments": [], "assistant_reply": "小林，我们把 $2x+3=11$ 按章节里的两步法走一遍。\n\n- 第一步：两边同时减去 3，把常数项从左边移到右边，得到 $2x = 11 - 3 = 8$。\n- 第二步：两边同时除以系数 2，孤立未知数，得到 $x = \\dfrac{8}{2} = 4$。\n- 第三步：把 $x=4$ 代回原式，左边 $2 \\times 4 + 3 = 11$，恰好等于右边 11，验证成立。\n\n下方代码块用 assert 把移项、求解、代回三步都钉死，便于你以后改题时直接复用。", "citations": [{"section_id": "doc-c5d887db81:section:l1:1", "title": "Chapter 1 Linear Equations", "page_start": 1, "page_end": 1, "source_kind": "document", "source_id": ""}], "character_events": [{"emotion": "calm", "action": "抬笔写下 2x+3=11，笔尖划向 2x=8，再点向 x=4。", "speech_style": "warm", "scene_hint": "study_session:doc-c5d887db81:study-unit:1:p1-1", "line_segment_id": "session-2e1efc5768:chat:0", "timing_hint": "after_text", "tool_name": "", "tool_summary": "", "delivery_cue": "节奏放稳，逐项点读等式两边，最后一句压低声调强调代入验证。", "commentary": "用户只要简洁可复用的解题与验证说明，故压缩为三步口述加一段 assert 代码，不出图、不出题。"}], "rich_blocks": [{"kind": "code", "content": "def solve_linear_equation():\n    # 待解方程：2x + 3 = 11\n    a, b, c = 2, 3, 11\n\n    # 第一步：两边减 b，移项得到 a*x = c - b\n    rhs_after_subtract = c - b\n    assert rhs_after_subtract == 8, f\"移项后期望 8，实际得到 {rhs_after_subtract}\"\n\n    # 第二步：两边除以 a，得到 x = (c - b) / a\n    x = rhs_after_subtract / a\n    assert x == 4, f\"求解后期望 x=4，实际得到 {x}\"\n\n    # 第三步：代回原方程验证\n    lhs = a * x + b\n    assert lhs == c, f\"代入后左边={lhs}，右边={c}，不一致\"\n\n    print(f\"x = {x},  2*{int(x)} + 3 = {int(lhs)},  等于 {c},  验证通过\")\n\nsolve_linear_equation()"}], "interactive_question": null, "persona_slot_trace": [{"kind": "teaching_method", "label": "Method", "content_excerpt": "Socratic", "reason": "作为人格基础策略默认参与"}], "memory_trace": [{"session_id": "session-a4bde6a660", "stud