{"scope": "live_study_operation_receipt_readback", "fixture_version": "study-quality-v1", "git_revision": "c8f5b43d3f1db4725fbd4c216eaf6b1b56c72342", "case_id": "unknown_source", "repetition": 0, "model": "MiniMax-M3", "message": "教材是否说过这个方法是陈老师于1987年发明的？请核对教材，找不到就明确说教材未提供，别编造作者和年份。", "calls": [{"kind": "chat", "model": "MiniMax-M3", "max_tokens": 4096, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 665, "prompt_tokens": 5131, "total_tokens": 5796, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 306, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 128}, "total_characters": 0}, "finish_reason": "stop", "elapsed_ms": 7536}], "http_status": 200, "receipt": {"operation_id": "study-chat-op-c5f5d818721e40a9", "session_id": "session-50d5fbd0ee", "client_request_id": "quality-unknown_source-0", "status": "committed", "safe_to_retry": false, "created_at": "2026-09-11T17:37:05.197000+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-11T17:37:12.961827+00:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-11T17:37:12.961827+00:00", "admitted_session_revision": 0, "committed_session_revision": 1, "committed_turn_id": "turn-6865485f3a39480b", "committed_turn_sequence": 1, "error_code": "", "result": {"reply": "小林，我先帮你核对一遍手头的教材依据。\n\n**教材原文关于解法步骤的部分**\n\n- 一元线性方程的标准形式是 $ax + b = c$，其中 $a \\neq 0$。\n- 解法分两步：先在等式两边同减 $b$，再两边同除以 $a$。\n- 教材用例题 $2x + 3 = 11 \\Rightarrow 2x = 8 \\Rightarrow \\ldots$ 演示了这一过程。\n\n**关于\"陈老师 1987 年发明\"的说法**\n\n教材摘录里没有出现任何作者署名，也没有出现年份信息；更具体地说：\n\n- 教材未提及\"陈老师\"或任何具体人物。\n- 教材未提及 1987 年或任何年份。\n- 教材也未给这种基础代数变换标注发明人或来源。\n\n所以可以明确告诉你：**教材未提供**这一出处信息，我不会替你补一个作者和年份进去。如果你手上有引用了\"陈老师 1987\"的课外资料，那属于教材之外的来源，需要回去核对那份资料本身，而不是这本教材。\n\n接下来要不要我把这一章的核心解法步骤再串一遍，或者直接拿 $2x + 3 = 11$ 这种典型例题带你做一遍？", "citations": [{"section_id": "doc-c5d887db81:section:l1:1", "title": "Chapter 1 Linear Equations", "page_start": 1, "page_end": 1, "source_kind": "document", "source_id": ""}], "character_events": [{"emotion": "calm", "action